2025-11-26 13:40:36,113 - blueprints.imaging_generators - INFO - GPT-Image-1 landscape API request: {'model': 'gpt-image-1', 'prompt': "Gentle warm pastel watercolor collage, blending multiple images into one undivided whole, with brushstrokes ending to sides creating white margins. A serene and nostalgic atmosphere unfolds as a group of friends gathered around a large table adorned with tartan tablecloths, plates, and cups enjoy traditional Scottish dishes like Cullen Skink and shortbread in the distance, their laughter and conversation filling the air. Flowing into the foreground, a weathered map of the ancient world reveals a faint outline of St Andrew's path etched into its surface, where a solitary figure in traditional Scottish attire stands at the edge of a misty sea, gazing out towards the horizon as if lost in thought. Overlapping with the figure, a stylized Saltire Flag waves gently in the breeze, its blue and white hues reminiscent of the sky and sea that surrounded Scotland's patron saint. Blending into the background, a bustling fairground scene set in Glasgow's West End comes alive with vintage carnival attractions, traditional Scottish music and food stalls, capturing the essence of St Andrew's Fair. As the eye wanders, it discovers a weathered X-shaped stake stands atop a rugged windswept hillside, evoking the site where St Andrew was martyred, subtly hinting at mist and distant mountains that evoke a sense of reverence and timelessness. In the distance, a sweeping landscape of Scotland's rugged hills with the silhouetted figure of St Andrew's cross standing proudly at an ancient Celtic crossroads, softly merging into the misty lochs and heather-covered background, which itself forms a subtle gradient of soft greens and weathered stone, as if kissed by the gentle light of dawn. with brushstrokes fading to white edges", 'n': 1, 'size': '1536x1024', 'quality': 'high'}
